            <ArticleTitle>Hip pain in active patients: what you may be missing.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>736-44</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>When a patient who's physically active complains of hip pain, don't be too quick to label it a &quot;hip pointer&quot; that requires time and rest to heal. Consider this more nuanced-and effective-approach.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
